<title>USA: AutoZone Inc Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>AutoZone Inc Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.30		    $0.25</p>
<p> Net			 46,103		   37,605</p>
<p> Net sales		637,895		  524,175</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 152,602		  151,541</p>
<p>	   36 Weeksended May 10, 1997 and May 4, 1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.74		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net			113,485		   99,726</p>
<p> Net sales	    1,745,052		1,413,042</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 152,389		  150,508</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>The company reported operating profits of $76.8 million vs $60.4 for the third quarter.</p>
<p>Analyst consensus for the quarter's earnings per share was $0.30, according to First Call.</p>
